{"page_id": "synth_copies-images_svcc395674-p1", "markdown": "# St Louis Lau13.\n\n- 1562\n\nAr sir.\n\nA fun\n\nud refores me that\n\nletta to me at Lorisvella, No, Suppon me to le their a 2g recenco\n\nA las\n\nprobably beer adrecitise.\n\nWe received forty-two crates of apples on the ninth of March, 1914.\n\nHe received forty-livo crales or apples on the ninth of March, 1914.", "width": 1654, "height": 2340, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "St Louis Lau13.", "bbox": {"x": 788.082354254647, "y": 326.62499922000006, "width": 588.6294117647058, "height": 77.99999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "- 1562", "bbox": {"x": 1364.7132057068638, "y": 329.76338488065, "width": 199.33636371388172, "height": 76.21664643287667}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ar sir.", "bbox": {"x": 257.4486617823031, "y": 432.8092266659082, "width": 258.77761966480927, "height": 67.21147942543028}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A fun", "bbox": {"x": 494.4925541649929, "y": 517.8790374616747, "width": 235.39235139734598, "height": 119.97575211524979}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ud refores me that", "bbox": {"x": 724.577524983626, "y": 544.7916475798313, "width": 788.8063876881318, "height": 81.47331476211556}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "letta to me at Lorisvella, No, Suppon me to le their a 2g recenco", "bbox": {"x": 177.92892796153563, "y": 695.0015434127004, "width": 1302.3333393770106, "height": 224.99174594879167}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A las", "bbox": {"x": 1240.4999996108236, "y": 823.8749999122499, "width": 243.2352941176471, "height": 43.87500000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "probably beer adrecitise.", "bbox": {"x": 184.8588229110169, "y": 906.7499999256354, "width": 1021.5882352941177, "height": 87.75000000000021}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "We received forty-two crates of apples on the ninth of March, 1914.", "bbox": {"x": 207.5889512207439, "y": 993.2003746317307, "width": 1278.0260662303251, "height": 235.4522681236267}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "He received forty-l